<view class="page workout-page"><view class="eyebrow">HYPERTROPHY</view><view class="title">开始训练</view><view class="subtle">动作、重量、次数、RPE；Watch 会自动补时长和消耗。</view><view class="split-row"><view wx:for="{{splits}}" wx:key="*this" class="split {{split===item?'active':''}}" data-split="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{watch}}" class="watch-note">⌚ Apple Watch 已记录：{{watch.minutes}} 分钟 · {{watch.calories}} kcal</view><view wx:else class="watch-note soft">训练结束后，Watch 的功能性力量训练会自动并到这里。</view><view wx:for="{{exercises}}" wx:key="index" class="exercise-card surface"><input class="exercise-name" value="{{item.name}}" data-i="{{index}}" bindinput="editName"/><view class="previous">上次：{{item.previous}}</view><view class="set-head"><text>组</text><text>重量 kg</text><text>次数</text><text>RPE</text><text></text></view><view wx:for="{{item.sets}}" wx:for-item="set" wx:for-index="si" wx:key="index" class="set-row"><text>{{si+1}}</text><input type="digit" value="{{set.weight}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-s="{{si}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="editSet"/><input type="number" value="{{set.reps}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-s="{{si}}" data-field="reps" bindinput="editSet"/><input type="digit" value="{{set.rpe}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-s="{{si}}" data-field="rpe" bindinput="editSet"/><view class="remove" data-i="{{index}}" data-s="{{si}}" bindtap="removeSet">×</view></view><view class="add" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="addSet">＋ 添加一组</view></view><button class="btn-primary save" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存本次训练</button></view>
